icult to attain for those like me who are too attached to mental concoction, home, relatives, friends, money, servants and assistants. You are the Supreme Personality of Godhead, uncontaminated by the modes of nature. You are the reservoir of all enlighte
nment, the supreme controller. I therefore offer my respectful obeisances unto You.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
