\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.5.38 - May the supremely powerful Personality of Godhead be pleased with us. The different directions are generated from His ears, the holes of the body come from His heart, and the vital force
