grace you have gotten the nectar. By the grace of the goddess of fortune, you are glorious in every way. Therefore, please stop this fighting.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.45 - \'c7r\'e9 \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 said: Accepting the words of N\'e4rada, the demigods gave up their anger and stopped fighting. Being praised by their followers, they returned to their heavenly planets.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.46 - Following the order of N\'e4rada Muni, whatever demons remained on the battlefield took Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, who was in a precarious condition, to the hill known as Astagiri.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.47 - There, on that hill, \'c7ukr\'e4c\'e4rya brought to life all the dead demoniac soldiers who had not lost their heads, trunks and limbs. He achieved this by his own mantra, known as Sa\'e0j\'e9van\'e9.
