eat us by displaying some mystic power, although you know that we are the masters of all such mystic powers.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.5 - Those fools and rascals who want to ascend to the upper planetary system by mystic power or mechanical means, or who endeavor to cross
 even the upper planets and achieve the spiritual world or liberation, I cause to be sent to the lowest region of the universe.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.6 - Today, with my thunderbolt, which has hundreds of sharp edges, I, the same powerful person, shall sever your head f
rom your body. Although you can produce so much jugglery through illusion, you are endowed with a poor fund of knowledge. Now, try to exist on this battlefield with your relatives and friends.
