\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.7 - Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja replied: All those present on this b
attlefield are certainly under the influence of eternal time, and according to their prescribed activities, they are destined to receive fame, victory, defeat and death, one after another.
