\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.17 - Appreciating M\'e4tali's service, Jambh\'e4sura, the best of the demons, smiled. Nonetheless, he struck M\'e4tali in the battle with a trident of blazing fire.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.18 - Although the pain was extremely severe, M\'e4tali tolerated it with great patience. Indra, however, became extremely angry at Jambh\'e4sura. He struck Jambh\'e4
sura with his thunderbolt and thus severed his head from his body.
