\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.11.32 - Although King Indra hurled his thunderbolt at Namuci with great force, it could not even pierce his skin. It is very wonderful that the famed thunderbolt that had pierced the body of V\'e5tr\'e4
