\'e5hadbh\'e4nu, and He will administer spiritual activities.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.13.36 - O King, I
 have now described to you the fourteen Manus appearing in the past, present and future. The total duration of time ruled by these Manus is one thousand yuga cycles. This is called a kalpa, or one day of Lord Brahm\'e4.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
