\cs1867\fs14\up12\insrsid10883103\charrsid4605116 \chftn }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.1 - \'c7r\'e9 \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 said: O King Par\'e9k\'f1it, when Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja was thus advised by his spiritual master, \'c7ukr\'e4c\'e4
rya, his family priest, he remained silent for some time, and then, after full deliberation, he replied to his spiritual master as follows.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.2 - Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja said: As you have already stated, the principle of religion that does not hinder one's economic development, sense gratification, fame and means of livelihood is t
he real occupational duty of the householder. I also think that this religious principle is correct.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.3 - I am the grandson of Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Prahl\'e4da. How can I withdraw my promise because of greed for money when I have already said that I shall give th
is land? How can I behave like an ordinary cheater, especially toward a br\'e4hma\'eba?
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.4 - There is nothing more sinful than untruthfulness. Because of this, mother earth once said, "I can bear any heavy thing except a person who is a liar."
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.5 - I do not fear hell, poverty, an ocean of distress, falldown from my position or even death itself as much as I fear cheating a br\'e4hma\'eba.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.6 - My lord, you can also see that all the material opulences of this world are certainly separated from their possessor at death. Therefore, if the br\'e4hma\'eba V\'e4
manadeva is not satisfied by whatever gifts one has given, why not please Him with the riches one is destined to lose at death?
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.7 - Dadh\'e9ci, \'c7ibi and many other great personalities were willing 
to sacrifice even their lives for the benefit of the people in general. This is the evidence of history. So why not give up this insignificant land? What is the serious consideration against it?
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.8 - O best of the br\'e4hma\'ebas, certainly the great dem
oniac kings who were never reluctant to fight enjoyed this world, but in due course of time everything they had was taken away, except their reputation, by which they continue to exist. In other words, one should try to achieve a good reputation instead o
f anything else.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.9 - O best of the br\'e4hma\'eb
as, many men have laid down their lives on the battlefield, being unafraid of fighting, but rarely has one gotten the chance to give his accumulated wealth faithfully to a saintly person who creates holy places.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.10 - By giving charity, a benevolent and merciful person undoubtedly becomes even more auspicious, especially when he gives charity to a person like your good self. Under the circumstances, I must give this little brahmac
\'e4r\'e9 whatever charity He wants from me.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.11 - O great sage, great saintly persons like you, being completely aware of the Vedic principles for performing ritualistic ceremonies and yaj\'efas, worship Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u in all circumstances. Therefore, whether that same Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu has come here to give me all benedictions or to punish me as an enemy, I must carry out His order and give Him the requested tract of land without hesitation.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.20.12 - Although He is Vi\'f1\'ebu Himself, out of fear He has covered Himself in the form of a br\'e4hma\'eba to come to me begging. Under the circumstances, because He has assumed the form of a br\'e4hma\'eb
a, even if He irreligiously arrests me or even kills me, I shall not retaliate, although He is my enemy.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
