\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.21 - The supreme time factor, which represents the Supreme Person, was previously in our favor and not in favor of the demigods, but now that same time factor is against us.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.22 - No one can surpass the time representation of 
the Supreme Personality of Godhead by material power, by the counsel of ministers, by intelligence, by diplomacy, by fortresses, by mystic mantras, by drugs, by herbs or by any other means.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.23 - Previously, being empowered by providence, you defeated a great number of such followers of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. But today those same followers, having defeated us, are roaring in jubilation like lions.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.24 - Unless providence is in our favor, we shall not be able to gain victory. Therefore we must wait for that favorable time when our defeating them will be possible.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.25 - \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9 continued: O King, in accordance with the order of their master, Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, all the chiefs of the demons and the Daityas entered the lower regions of the unive
rse, to which they were driven by the soldiers of Vi\'f1\'ebu.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.26 - Thereafter, on the day of soma-p\'e4na, after the sacrifice was finished, Garu\'f2a, king of the birds, understanding the desire of his master, arrested Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja with the ropes of Varu\'eba.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.27 - When Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja was thus arrested by Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, who is the most powerful, there was a great roar of lamentation in all directions throughout the upper and lower planetary systems of the universe.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.28 - O King, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, V\'e4manadeva, then spoke to Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, the most liberal and celebrated personality whom He had arrested with the ropes of Varu\'eba. Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja had lost all bodily luster, but he was nonetheless fixed in his determination.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.29 - O King of the demons, you have promised to give Me three steps of land, but I have occupied the entire universe with two steps. Now think about where I should put My third.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.30 - As far as the sun and moon shine with the stars and as far as the clouds pour rain, all the land throughout the universe is in your possession.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.31 - Of these possessions, with one step I have occupied Bh\'fcrloka, and with My body I have occupied the entire sky and all directions. And in your presence, with My second
 step, I have occupied the upper planetary system.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.32 - Because you have been unable to give charity according to your promise, the rule is that you should go down to live in the hellish planets. Therefore, in accordance with the order of \'c7ukr\'e4c\'e4r
ya, your spiritual master, now go down and live there.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.33 - Far from being elevated to the heavenly planets or fulfilling one's desire, one who does not properly give a beggar what he has promised falls down to a hellish condition of life.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.21.34 - Being falsely proud of your possessions, you promised to give Me land, but you could not fulfill your promise. Therefore, because your promise was false, you must live for a few years in hellish life.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }}}{\f35\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Translations 1-34
