eved the benediction of the Lord, he spoke as follows in a tone of greatly ecstatic devotion.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.23.6 - Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja said: O Supreme Personality of Godhead, You are universally worshiped; even Lord Brahm\'e4 and Lord \'c7iva worship Your lotus feet. Yet 
although You are such a great personality, You have kindly promised to protect us, the demons. I think that such kindness has never been achieved even by Lord Brahm\'e4, Lord \'c7iva or the goddess of fortune, Lak\'f1m\'e9
, what to speak of other demigods or common people.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
\par }{\fs28\insrsid10883103 SB 8.23.7 - O supreme shelter of everyone, great personalities like Brahm\'e4
 enjoy their perfection simply by tasting the honey of rendering service at Your lotus feet. But as for us, who are all rogues and debauchees born of an envious family of demo
ns, how have we received Your mercy? It has been possible only because Your mercy is causeless.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
