, You have created all the universes. As the Supersoul of all living entities, You are aware of everything, and therefore You are certainly equal toward everyone. Nonetheless, You favor Your devotees. This is not partiality, however, for Your characterist
ic is just like that of a desire tree, which yields everything according to one's desire.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
