 and adhvaryu]. O Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Par\'e9k\'f1it, these priests were all brahma-v\'e4d\'e9s, followers of the Vedic principles for performing sacrifices.
\par }{\b0\cf0\insrsid10883103 
