\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 yasya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash of whom (the Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4di}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash a beginning; }{
