\par }\pard\plain \s1140\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb120\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\cf9\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sa\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
that Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 vi\'e7va-k\'e4ya\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash the total form of the universe (the whole universe is the external body of the Supreme Personality of Godhead); 
}{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 puru-h\'fcta\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash known by so many names; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e9\'e7a\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
the supreme controller (with full power); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 satya\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash the ultimate truth; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 svayam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
personally; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 jyoti\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash self-effulgent; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 aja\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash unborn, beginningless; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 pur\'e4\'eba\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash the oldest; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 dhatte}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash He performs; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 asya}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash of this universe; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 janma-\'e4di}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash the creation, maintenance and annihilation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ajay\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash by His external energy; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4tma-\'e7akty\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash by His personal potency; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 t\'e4m}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash that external material energy; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 vidyay\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash by His spiritual potency; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 udasya}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash giving up; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nir\'e9ha\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash without any desire or activity; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4ste}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash He is existing (untouched by the material energy).
\par }\pard\plain \s2995\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4283093 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s3003\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6049549 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 
The entire cosmic manifestation is the body of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, the Absolute Truth, who has millions of names and unlimited potencies. He is self-effulgent, unborn
 and changeless. He is the beginning of everything, but He has no beginning. Because He has created this cosmic manifestation by His external energy, the universe appears to be created, maintained and annihilated by Him. Nonetheless, He remains inactive i
n His spiritual energy and is untouched by the activities of the material energy.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu says in His }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c7ik\'f1\'e4\'f1\'f6aka, n\'e4mn\'e4m ak\'e4ri bahudh\'e4 nija-sarva-\'e7akti\'f9:}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  the Supreme Personality of Godhead has many names, which are all nondifferent f
rom the Supreme Person. This is spiritual existence. By chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4-mantra,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 consisting of names of the Supreme Lord, we find that the name has all the potencies of the person. The Lord's activities are many, and according to His activities He has many names. He appeared as the son of mother Ya\'e7od\'e4
, and also as the son of mother Devak\'e9, and therefore He is named Devak\'e9-nandana and Ya\'e7od\'e4-nandana. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Par\'e4sya \'e7aktir vividhaiva \'e7r\'fcyate: }{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
the Lord has a multitude of energies, and therefore He acts in multifarious ways. Yet He has a particular name. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7\'e4stras}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 recommend which names we should chant, such as Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare. It is not that we have to search for some name or manufacture one. Rather, we must follow the saintly persons and the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7\'e4stras}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  in chanting His holy name.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
Although the material and spiritual energies both belong to the Lord, He is impossible to understand as long as we are in the material energy. And when we come to the spiritual energy, He is very easy to know. As stated in }{
\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  (1.7.23): }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 m\'e4y\'e4\'e0 vyudasya cic-chakty\'e4 kaivalye sthita \'e4tmani.}{
\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  Although the external energy belongs to the Lord, when one is in the external energy (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mama m\'e4y\'e4 duratyay\'e4}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
) He is very difficult to understand. However, when one comes to the spiritual energy, one can understand Him. Therefore in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  (18.55) it is said, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 bhakty\'e4 m\'e4m abhij\'e4n\'e4ti y\'e4v\'e4n ya\'e7 c\'e4smi tattvata\'f9:}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
 one who wants to understand the Supreme Personality of Godhead in reality must take to the platform of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 bhakti,}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  or K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. This }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 bhakti}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  consists of various activities (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtana\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9 smara\'eba\'e0 p\'e4da-sevanam/ arcana\'e0
 vandana\'e0 d\'e4sya\'e0 sakhyam \'e4tma-nivedanam}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 ), and to understand the Lord one must take to this path of devotional service. E
ven though the people of the world have forgotten God and may say that God is dead, this is not a fact. One can understand God when one takes to the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement, and thus one can be happy.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.1.14
