, maintainer and annihilator of this material world. In spite of acting in that way, He is never entangled. Hence devotees who follow in His footsteps are also never entangled.
\par }\pard\plain \s2995\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4283093 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}
{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (3.9), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 yaj\'ef\'e4rth\'e4t karma\'ebo 'nyatra loko 'ya\'e0 karma-bandhana\'f9:}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  "Work done as a sacrifice for Vi\'f1\'eb
u has to be performed, otherwise work binds one to this material world." If we do not act in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness we shall be entangled, like silkworms in cocoons. The Supreme Personality of Godhead, K\'e5\'f1\'eba,
 appears in order to teach us how to work so that we will not be entangled in this material world. Our real problem is that we are entangled in materialistic activities, and because we are conditioned, our struggle continues through punishment in material
 existence in one body after another in different forms of life. As the Lord says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (15.7):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mamaiv\'e4\'e0\'e7o j\'e9va-loke\line j\'e9va-bh\'fcta\'f9 san\'e4tana\'f9\line mana\'f9
 \'f1a\'f1\'f6h\'e4n\'e9ndriy\'e4\'ebi\line prak\'e5ti-sth\'e4ni kar\'f1ati
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "The living entities in this conditioned world are My eternal
, fragmental parts. Due to conditioned life, they are struggling very hard with the six senses, which include the mind." The living entities are actually minute forms who are part and parcel of the Supreme Lord. The Supreme Lord is full in everything, and
 
the small particles of the Lord are also originally qualified like Him, but because of their minute existence, they are infected by material attraction and thus entangled. We must therefore follow the instructions of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, an
d then, like K\'e5\'f1\'eba, who is never entangled by His material activities of creation, maintenance and annihilation, we will have nothing for which to lament (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 n\'e4vas\'e9danti ye 'nu tam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
). K\'e5\'f1\'eba personally gives instructions in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and anyone who follows these instructions is liberated.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 Following K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a's instructions is possible when one is a devotee, for K\'e5\'f1\'eba instructs that one should become a devotee. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Man-man\'e4 bhava mad-bhakto mad-y\'e4j\'e9 m\'e4\'e0 namaskuru:}{
\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  "Always think of Me and become My devotee. Worship Me and offer your homage unto Me." (Bg. 18.65) Always thinking of K\'e5\'f1\'eba means chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra,}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  but unless one is an initiated devotee he cannot do this. As soon as one becomes a devotee, he engages in Deity worship (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mad-y
\'e4j\'e9}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 ). A devotee's business is to offer obeisances to the Lord and the spiritual master constantly. This principle is the recognized way to come to the platform of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
bhakti.}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  As soon as one comes to this platform, he gradually understands the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and simply by understanding K\'e5\'f1\'eba one is liberated from material bondage.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.1.16
\par }\pard\plain \s2994\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4605116 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 TEXT 16
\par }\pard\plain \s1168\qr \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 TEXT
\par }\pard\plain \s2993\qc \li0\ri0\sa360\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4605116 \b\v\f70\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 TaMaqhMaaNa& iNarhx(k*-Ta& buDa&\line  iNaraiXaz& PaU<aRMaNaNYacaeidTaMa( )
\line Na\'9bHa( iXa+aYaNTa& iNaJavTMaRSa&iSQaTa&\line  Pa[>au& Pa[Pa}{\f0\insrsid4605116 \'db}{\f35\insrsid4605116 e_i%l/DaMaR>aavNaMa( )) 16 ))}{\insrsid4605116 
\par }\pard\plain \s23\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 tam \'e9ham\'e4na\'e0 niraha\'eck\'e5ta\'e0 budha\'e0
\par nir\'e4\'e7i\'f1a\'e0 p\'fcr\'ebam ananya-coditam
\par n\'e8\'ef \'e7ik\'f1ayanta\'e0 nija-vartma-sa\'e0sthita\'e0
\par prabhu\'e0 prapadye 'khila-dharma-bh\'e4vanam
\par }\pard\plain \s2997\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10300851 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v\insrsid4283093 SYNONYMS}{\v\insrsid4605116 
\par }\pard\plain \s1140\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb120\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\cf9\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 tam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
unto the same Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e9ham\'e4nam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who is acting for our benefit; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 niraha\'eck\'e5tam}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who is without entanglement or desire for gain; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 budham}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who is completely in knowledge; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nir\'e4\'e7i\'f1am}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash without desires to enjoy the fruits of His activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 p\'fcr\'ebam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
who is full and therefore has no need to fulfill desires; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ananya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash by others; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 coditam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
induced or inspired; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 n\'e8n}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash all of human society; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e7ik\'f1ayantam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
to teach (the real path of life); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nija-vartma}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash His own personal way of life; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sa\'e0sthitam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
\emdash to establish (without deviation); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 prabhum}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash unto the Supreme Lord; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 prapadye}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
I request everyone to surrender; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 akhila-dharma-bh\'e4vanam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who is the master of all religious principles or the occupational duties for a human being.
\par }\pard\plain \s2995\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4283093 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s3003\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6049549 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 The Supreme Personality of Godhead, K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, works just like an ordinary human being, yet He does not desire to enjoy the fruits of work. He is full in knowl
edge, free from material desires and diversions, and completely independent. As the supreme teacher of human society, He teaches His own way of activities, and thus He inaugurates the real path of religion. I request everyone to follow Him.
\par }\pard\plain \s2995\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4283093 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 This is the sum and substance of our K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement. We are simply requesting human society to follow in the footsteps of the teacher of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  Follow the instructions of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 As It Is,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  and your life will be successful. That is the summary of the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement. The organizer of the K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement is teaching everyone how to follow Lord R\'e4macandra, how to follow Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba, and how to follow \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu. In this material world, we need a leader for a monarchy or good government. Lord \'c7r
\'e9 R\'e4macandra, by His practical example, showed how to live for the benefit of all human society. He fought with demons like R\'e4va\'eba, He carried out the orders of His father, and He remained the faithful husband of mother S\'e9t\'e4
. Thus there is no comparison to Lord R\'e4macandra's acting as an ideal king. Indeed, people still hanker for }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 r\'e4ma-r\'e4jya,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 a government conducted like that of Lord R\'e4macandra. Similarly, although Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the Supreme Personality of Godhead, He taught His disciple and devotee Arjuna how to lead a life ending in going back home, back to Godhead (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 tyaktv\'e4 deha\'e0 punar janma naiti m\'e4m eti so 'rjuna}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 ). All teachings\emdash political, economic, social, religious, cultural and philosophical\emdash 
are to be found in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 One only has to follow them strictly. The Supreme Personality of Godhead also comes as Lord Caitanya just to play the part of a pure devotee. Thus the Lord teaches us in different ways just to make our lives successful, and Sv\'e4yambhuva Manu r
equests us to follow Him.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 Sv\'e4
yambhuva Manu is the leader of mankind, and he has given a book called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Manu-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
 to guide human society. Herein he directs us to follow the Supreme Personality of Godhead in His different incarnations. These incarnations are described in Vedic literature, and Jayadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9
 has described ten important incarnations in summary (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ke\'e7ava dh\'e5ta-m\'e9na-\'e7ar\'e9ra jaya jagad-\'e9\'e7a hare, ke\'e7ava dh\'e5ta-nara-hari-r\'fcpa jaya jagad-\'e9\'e7a hare, ke\'e7ava dh\'e5ta-buddha-\'e7ar
\'e9ra jaya jagad-\'e9\'e7a hare,}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  etc.). Sv\'e4yambhuva Manu instructs us to follow the instructions of God's incarnations, especially K\'e5\'f1\'eba's instructions of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4 As It Is.
\par }{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 Appreciating }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 bhakti-m\'e4rga}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  as instructed by \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu, S\'e4rvabhauma Bha\'f6\'f6\'e4c\'e4
rya thus depicted the activities of \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 vair\'e4gya-vidy\'e4-nija-bhakti-yoga-\line \'e7ik\'f1\'e4rtham eka\'f9 puru\'f1a\'f9
 pur\'e4\'eba\'f9\line \'e7r\'e9-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-caitanya-\'e7ar\'e9ra-dh\'e4r\'e9\line k\'e5p\'e4mbudhir yas tam aha\'e0 prapadye}{\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "Let me take shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, who has descended in the form of Lord Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu to teach us real knowledge, His devotional service, and detachment from whatever does not foster K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. He has descended because He is an ocean of transcendental mercy. Let me surrender unto His lotus feet." (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Caitanya-candrodaya-n\'e4\'f6aka}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 6.74) In this age of Kali, people cannot follow the instructions of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and therefore the Lord Himself takes the part of \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eba Caitanya to teach personally how to become K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious. He
 asks everyone to follow Him and to become a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  to deliver the fallen souls of Kali-yuga.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 y\'e4re dekha, t\'e4re kaha 'k\'e5\'f1\'eba'-upade\'e7a\line \'e4m\'e4ra \'e4j\'ef\'e4
ya guru ha\'ef\'e4 t\'e4ra' ei de\'e7a
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "Instruct everyone to follow the orders of Lord \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a as they are given in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 In this way become a spiritual master and try to liberate everyone in this land." (Cc. }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Madhya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  7.128) The coherent purpose of Lord R\'e4macandra, Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba and Lord Caitanya Mah\'e4
prabhu is to teach human society how to be happy by following the instructions of the Supreme Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.1.17
