\par }\pard \qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\insrsid4605116 In the midst of the ocean of milk, there is a very high and beautiful mountain that has an altitude of ten thousand }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 yojanas,}{\insrsid4605116 
