hant became reduced in strength, the crocodile became more and more powerful. Now, from this we may take the lesson that in our fight with }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
