that (Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 y\'e4mi}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash take shelter of; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 param}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
who is transcendental; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 par\'e4ya\'ebam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash and who is the shelter of even the exalted demigods like Brahm\'e4 and \'c7iva.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s3003\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6049549 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 The other elephants, who are my friends and relatives, could not rescu
e me from this danger. What then to speak of my wives? They cannot do anything. It is by the will of providence that I have been attacked by this crocodile, and therefore I shall seek shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is always the shelte
r of everyone, even of great personalities.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 This material world is described as }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 pada\'e0 pada\'e0 yad vipad\'e4m,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 which means that at every step there is danger. A fool wrongly thinks that he is happy in this material world, but in fact he is not, for one wh
o thinks that way is only illusioned. At every step, at every moment, there is danger. In modern civilization one thinks that if he has a nice home and a nice car his life is perfect. In the Western countries, especially in America, it is very nice to pos
s
ess a good car, but as soon as one is on the road, there is danger because at any moment an accident may take place and one will be killed. The record actually shows that so many people die in such accidents. Therefore if we actually think that this mater
i
al world is a very happy place, this is our ignorance. Real knowledge is that this material world is full of danger. We may struggle for existence as far as our intelligence allows and may try to take care of ourselves, but unless the Supreme Personality 
of Godhead, K\'e5\'f1\'eba, ultimately saves us from danger, our attempts will be useless. Therefore Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja says:
\par }\pard\plain \s1434\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 b\'e4lasya neha \'e7ara\'eba\'e0 pitarau n\'e5si\'e0ha\line n\'e4rtasya c\'e4
gadam udanvati majjato nau\'f9\line taptasya tat-pratividhir ya ih\'e4\'efjase\'f1\'f6as\line t\'e4vad vibho tanu-bh\'e5t\'e4\'e0 tvad-upek\'f1it\'e4n\'e4m\line (}{\cs2542\fs28\cf1\insrsid1837309\charrsid1837309 Bh\'e4g.}{
\i0\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid8660648  7.9.19)
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
We may invent so many ways to be happy or to counteract the dangers of this material world, but unless our attempts are sanctioned by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, they will never make us happy. Those who try to be hap
py without taking shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead are }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 m\'fc\'f2has,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  rascals. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Na m\'e4\'e0 du\'f1k\'e5tino m\'fc\'f2h\'e4\'f9 prapadyante nar
\'e4dham\'e4\'f9.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  Those who are the lowest of men refuse to take to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness because they think that they will be able to protect themselves without K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a's care. This is their mistake. The decision of the King of the elephants, Gajendra, was correct. In such a dangerous position, he sought shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.2.33
