He who (the Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ka\'e7cana}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash someone; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e9\'e7a\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
