from the great serpent of time, which brings death; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 praca\'eb\'f2a-veg\'e4t}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash whose force is fearful; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 abhidh\'e4vata\'f9}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who is chasing; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 bh\'e5\'e7am}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash endlessly (every hour and every minute); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 bh\'e9tam}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash one who is afraid of death; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 prapannam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who is surrendered (to the Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 parip\'e4ti}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash He protects; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 yat-bhay\'e4t}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash from fear of the Lord; }{
