\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ca}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash also; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 janma}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash birth; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 karma}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 v\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash or; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 na}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash nor; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 n\'e4ma-r\'fcpe}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash any material name or material form; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 gu\'eba}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash qualities; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 do\'f1a\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash fault; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 eva}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash certainly; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 v\'e4}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash either; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 tath\'e4pi}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash still; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 loka}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
of this cosmic manifestation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 apyaya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who is the destruction; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sambhav\'e4ya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
and creation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ya\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash He who; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sva-m\'e4yay\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash by His own potency; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 t\'e4ni}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 anuk\'e4lam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash eternally; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e5cchati}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash accepts; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 tasmai}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash unto Him; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nama\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
\emdash I offer my obeisances; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 para}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash transcendental; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e9\'e7\'e4ya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
who is the supreme controller; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 brahma\'ebe}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash w}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid352899 ho is the Supreme Brahman (Para}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 brahman); }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ananta-\'e7aktaye}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash with unlimited potency; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ar\'fcp\'e4ya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash possessing no material form; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 uru-r\'fcp\'e4ya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash possessing various forms as incarnations; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nama\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
I offer my obeisances; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4\'e7carya-karma\'ebe}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash whose activities are wonderful.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s3003\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6049549 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 The Supreme Personality
 of Godhead has no material birth, activities, name, form, qualities or faults. To fulfill the purpose for which this material world is created and destroyed, He comes in the form of a human being like Lord R\'e4ma or Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a by His original internal potency. He has immense potency, and in various forms, all free from material contamination, He acts wonderfully. He is therefore the Supreme Brahman. I offer my respects to Him.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 In the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Vi\'f1\'ebu Pur\'e4\'eba}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  it is said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 gu\'eb\'e4\'e0\'e7 ca do\'f1\'e4\'e0\'e7 ca mune vyat\'e9ta samasta-kaly\'e4\'eba-gu\'eb\'e4tmako hi.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 The Supreme Personality of Godhead has no material form, qualities or faults. He is spiritual and is the only reservoir of all spiritual qualities. As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (4.8) by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 paritr\'e4\'eb\'e4ya s\'e4dh\'fcn\'e4\'e0 vin\'e4\'e7\'e4ya ca du\'f1k\'e5t\'e4m.}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 The Lord's activities of saving the devotees and annihilating the demons are transcendental. Anyone annihilated by the Supreme Personality of Godhead gets the same result as a devotee who is protected by the Lord; both of them a
re transcendentally promoted. The only difference is that a devotee goes directly to the spiritual planets and becomes an associate of the Supreme Lord, whereas demons are promoted to }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 brahmaloka,}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  the impersonal effulgence of the Lord. Both of them, however
, are transcendentally promoted. The Lord's killing or annihilating of the demons is not exactly like the killing of this material world. Although He appears to act within the modes of material nature, He is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 nirgu\'eba,
}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  above the modes of nature. His name is not material; otherwise how could one get liberation by chanting Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare R\'e4ma? The names of the Lord like R\'e4ma and K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a are nondifferent from the person R\'e4ma and K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Thus by chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  one constantly associates with R\'e4ma and K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and therefore becomes liberated. A practical example is Aj\'e4mila, who always remained transcendental to his activities simply by chanting the name N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba. If this was true of Aj\'e4
mila, what is to be said of the Supreme Lord? When the Lord comes to this material world, He does not become a product of matter. This is confirmed throughout }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 janma-karma ca me divyam, avaj\'e4nanti m\'e4\'e0 m\'fc\'f2h\'e4\'f9 m\'e4nu\'f1\'e9\'e0 tanum \'e4\'e7ritam}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
). Therefore, when the Supreme Personality of Godhead\emdash R\'e4ma or K\'e5\'f1\'eba\emdash 
descends to act transcendentally for our benefit, we should not consider Him an ordinary human being. When the Lord comes, He does so on the basis of His spiritual potency (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sambhav\'e4my \'e4tma-m\'e4yay\'e4}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 ). Because He is not forced to come by
 the material energy, He is always transcendental. One should not consider the Supreme Lord an ordinary human being. Material names and forms are contaminated, but spiritual name and spiritual form are transcendental.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.3.10
\par }\pard\plain \s2994\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4605116 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 TEXT 10
