\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 antary\'e4m\'e9;}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 puru\'f1\'e4ya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash the Supreme Person; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4tma-m
\'fcl\'e4ya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash who are the original source of everything; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 m\'fcla-prak\'e5taye}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash unto the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 
puru\'f1a-avat\'e4ra,}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  the origin of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 prak\'e5ti}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 pradh\'e4na;}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nama\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash I offer my respectful obeisances.
