y of the Supreme Lord and becomes self-realized. In other words, although a devotee may externally not be very well educated, because of his devotional service the Supreme Personality of Godhead gives him enlightenment from within. If the Lord gives enlig
htenment from within, how can one be in ignorance? Therefore the allegation of the M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9s that the devotional path is for the unintelligent or uneducated is untrue.
