{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 vi\'f1\'ebu-tattva,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  which is all-pervading. This all-pervading feature of the Supreme Personality of Godhead is explained in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 B
hagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (10.42), wherein the Lord says:
