hough the Supreme Personality of Godhead comes into the material world, He is unaffected by the modes of material nature. This is confirmed in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c9\'e7opani\'f1ad.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Ap\'e4pa-viddham:}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  He is not contaminated. This same fact is described here. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Gu\'eba-sa\'ecga-vivarjit\'e4ya.}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  Although the Supreme Personality of Godhead appears as an incarnation within this material world, He is unaffected by the modes of material nature. As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (9.11), }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 avaj\'e4nanti m\'e4\'e0 m\'fc\'f2h\'e4 m\'e4nu\'f1\'e9\'e0 tanum \'e4\'e7ritam:}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 foolish men with insufficient knowledge deride the Personality of Godhead because He appears just like a human being. Therefore the Supreme Personality of Godhead can be understood only by the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mukt\'e4tm\'e4,}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  the liberated soul. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Mukt\'e4tmabhi\'f9 sva-h\'e5daye paribh\'e4vit\'e4ya:}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  only the liberated person c
an constantly think of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Such a person is the greatest of all }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 yog\'e9s.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 yogin\'e4m api sarve\'f1\'e4\'e0\line mad-gaten\'e4ntar\'e4tman\'e4\line \'e7raddh\'e4v
