Ye yath\'e4 m\'e4\'e0 prapadyante t\'e4\'e0s tathaiva bhaj\'e4my aham.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  The Lord reciprocates. Whatever even an ordinary living entity wants, K\'e5\'f1\'eba gives. K\'e5\'f1\'eba is situated in everyone's heart, and H
e gives that which is desired by the living entity.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e9\'e7vara\'f9 sarva-bh\'fct\'e4n\'e4\'e0\line h\'e5d-de\'e7e 'rjuna ti\'f1\'f6hati
