The King of the elephants, Gajendra, simply accepted that there must be someone who has created this cosmic manifestation and has supplied its ingredients. This should 
be admitted by everyone, even the most determined atheists. Why, then, do the nondevotees and atheists not admit this? The reason is that they are polluted by the reactions of their fruitive activities. One must be freed from all the dirt accumulated with
in the heart due to fruitive activities performed one after another. One must wash off this dirt by practicing }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 bhakti-yoga.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
Yoga-randhita-karm\'e4\'eba\'f9.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  As long as one is covered by material nature's modes of ignorance and passion, there is no possibility of understanding the Supreme Lord. }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Tad\'e4 rajas-tamo-bh\'e4v\'e4\'f9 k\'e4ma-lobh\'e4daya\'e7 ca ye.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  When one is freed from the modes of ignorance and passion, one becomes free from the lowest qualities}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid14510721 \emdash }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 k\'e4ma}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 lobha,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  lust and greed.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 Nowadays there are so many }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 yoga}{
