 is one who always meditates on the lotus feet of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. This is also confirmed in the }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Brahma-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  (5.38):
