Gajendra had been forcefully captured by the crocodile in the water and was feeling acute pain, but when he saw that N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, wielding His disc, was coming in the sky on the back of Garu\'f2
a, he immediately took a lotus flower in his trunk, and with great difficulty due to his painful condition, he uttered the following words: "O my Lord, N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, master of the 
universe, O Supreme Personality of Godhead, I offer my respectful obeisances unto You."
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
