i, he became a crocodile a
nd in only one life was fortunate enough to see the Supreme Personality of Godhead face to face and be promoted to the spiritual world to become one of the Lord's associates. Similarly, Gajendra was also delivered by the Supreme Personality of Godhead whe
n he was freed from the curse of Agastya Muni.
