the body of the Supreme Lord, but simply by hearing about His pastimes, chanting His glories, touching His feet and offering worship\emdash in other words, by serving the Lord somehow or other\emdash 
one is purified of material contamination. This is the result of touching the Supreme Lord. One who is a pure devotee (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 any\'e4bhil\'e4\'f1it\'e4-\'e7\'fcnyam}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
