 Yet although Agastya Muni cursed Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Indradyumna to become an elephant, the curse was indirectly a benediction, for by undergoing one life as an elephant, Indradyumna Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja ended the reactions for all the sins of his previous life. Immediately after the expiry of the elephant's life, he was promoted to Vaiku\'eb\'f6haloka to become a personal associate of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a, in a body exactly like that of the Lord. This is called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 s\'e4r\'fcpya-mukti.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.4.11-12
