ya}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  is significant. For a devotee, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mok\'f1a}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mukti}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash salvation\emdash means getting the position of the Lord's associate. The impersonalists are satisfied to get the liberation of merging in the Brahman effulgence, but for a devotee, }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mukti}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (liberation) means not to merge in the effulgence of the Lord, but to be directly promoted to the Vaiku\'eb\'f6
ha planets and to become an associate of the Lord. In this regard, there is a relevant verse in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (10.14.8):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 tat te 'nukamp\'e4\'e0 susam\'e9k\'f1am\'e4\'ebo\line bhu\'efj\'e4na ev\'e4tma-k\'e5ta
\'e0 vip\'e4kam\line h\'e5d-v\'e4g-vapurbhir vidadhan namas te\line j\'e9veta yo mukti-pade sa d\'e4ya-bh\'e4k
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "One who seeks Your compassion and thus tolerates all kinds of adverse conditions due to the 
}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 karma}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  of his past deeds, who engages alway
s in Your devotional service with his mind, words and body, and who always offers obeisances unto You, is certainly a bona fide candidate for liberation." A devotee who tolerates everything in this material world and patiently executes his devotional serv
ice can become }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mukti-pade sa d\'e4ya-bh\'e4k,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  a bona fide candidate for liberation. The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 d\'e4ya-bh\'e4k}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 refers to a hereditary right to the Lord's mercy. A devotee must simply engage in devotional service, not caring about material situations. Then he automatically becomes a rightful candidate for promotion to Vaiku\'eb\'f6
haloka. The devotee who renders unalloyed service to the Lord gets the right to be promoted to Vaiku\'eb\'f6haloka, just as a son inherits the property of his father.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 When a devotee gets liberation, he becom
es free from material contamination and engages as a servant of the Lord. This is explained in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  (2.10.6): }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
muktir hitv\'e4nyath\'e4 r\'fcpa\'e0 svar\'fcpena vyavasthiti\'f9.}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 svar\'fcpa}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  refers to }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 s\'e4r\'fcpya-mukti}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 \emdash going back home, back to Godhead, and remai
ning the Lord's eternal associate, having regained a spiritual body exactly resembling that of the Lord, with four hands, holding the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7a\'eckha, cakra, gad\'e4}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 padma.}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  The difference between the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mukti}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
 of the impersonalist and that of the devotee is that the devotee is immediately appointed an eternal servant of the Lord, whereas the impersonalist, although merging in the effulgence of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid612083 brahmajyoti}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ,}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  is still insecure and therefore generally falls again to this material world. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c4ruhya k\'e5cchre\'eba para\'e0 pada\'e0 tata\'f9
