\par }\pard\plain \s3015\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7616644 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 When K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a appeared, He gave His orders, and when K\'e5\'f1\'eba Himself appeared as a devotee, as \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu, He showed us the path by which to cross the ocean of Kali-yuga. That is the path of the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba movement. When \'c7r
\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu appeared, He ushered in the era for the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3017\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  movement. It is also said that for ten thousand years this era will continue. This me
ans that simply by accepting the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3017\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  movement and chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4-mantra,}{\cs3017\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
 the fallen souls of this Kali-yuga will be delivered. After the Battle of Kuruk\'f1etra, at which }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3017\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  was spoken, Kali-yuga continues for 432,000 years, of
 which only 5,000 years have passed. Thus there is still a balance of 427,000 years to come. Of these 427,000 years, the 10,000 years of the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{\cs3017\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  movement inaugurated by \'c7r
\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu 500 years ago provide the opportunity for the fallen souls of Kali-yuga to take to the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement, chant the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4-mantra}{\insrsid4605116 
 and thus be delivered from the clutches of material existence and return home, back to Godhead.
\par Chanting of the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4-mantra}{\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  is potent always, but it is especially potent in this age of Kali. Therefore \'c7ukadeva Gosv\'e4m\'e9, while instructing Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Par
\'e9k\'f1it, stressed this chanting of the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 mantra.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 kaler do\'f1a-nidhe r\'e4jann\line asti hy eko mah\'e4n gu\'eba\'f9\line k\'e9rtan\'e4
d eva k\'e5\'f1\'ebasya\line mukta-sa\'ecga\'f9 para\'e0 vrajet
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "My de
ar King, although Kali-yuga is full of faults, there is still one good quality about this age. It is that simply by chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4-mantra,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 one can become free from material bondage and be promoted to the transcendental kingdom." (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1837309\charrsid1837309 Bh\'e4g.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  12.3.51) Those who have accepted the task of spreading the Hare K\'e5\'f1
\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4-mantra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  in full K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness should take this opportunity to deliver people very easily from the clutches of material existence. Our duty, therefore, is to follow the instructions of \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu and preach the K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement all over the world very sincerely. This is the best welfare activity for the peace and prosperity of human society.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu's movement consists of spreading }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 k\'e5\'f1\'eba-sa\'eck\'e9rtana.}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Para\'e0 vijayate \'e7r\'e9-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-sa\'eck\'e9rtanam:}{
\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  "All glories to the \'c7r\'e9 K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sa\'eck\'e9rtana!}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 " Why is it so glorious? This has also been explained by 
\'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Ceto-darpa\'eba-m\'e4rjanam:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  }{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 by the chanting of the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4-mantra,}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  one's heart is cleansed. The whole difficulty is that in this age of Kali there is no }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sattva-gu\'eba}{
\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  and no clearance of the heart, and therefore people are making the mistake of identifying with their bodies. Even the big philosophers and scientists with whom we deal are practi
cally all under the impression that they are their bodies. The other day we were discussing a prominent philosopher, Thomas Huxley, who was proud of being an Englishman. This means that he was in the bodily conception of life. Everywhere we find this same
 misunderstanding. As soon as one is in the bodily conception of life, one is nothing but an animal like a cat or a dog (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sa eva go-khara\'f9}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
). Thus the most dangerous of the dirty things within our hearts is this misidentification of the body as the self. Unde
r the influence of this misunderstanding, one thinks, "I am this body. I am an Englishman. I am an Indian. I am an American. I am Hindu. I am Muslim." This misconception is the strongest impediment, and it must be removed. That is the instruction of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  and of \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu. Indeed, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  begins with this instruction:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 dehino 'smin yath\'e4 dehe\line kaum\'e4ra\'e0 yauvana\'e0 jar\'e4\line tath\'e4 deh\'e4
ntara-pr\'e4ptir\line dh\'e9ras tatra na muhyati
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "As the embodied soul continually passes, in this body, from boyhood 
to youth to old age, the soul similarly passes into another body at death. The self-realized soul is not bewildered by such a change." (Bg. 2.13) Although the soul is within the body, nevertheless, because of misunderstanding and animal propensities one a
ccepts the body as the self. Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu therefore says, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ceto-darpa\'eba-m\'e4rjanam.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  To cleanse the core of the heart, which is full of misunderstanding, is possible only through }
{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7r\'e9-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-sa\'eck\'e9rtana.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  The leaders of the K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement shoul
d very seriously take this opportunity to be kind to the fallen souls by delivering them from the misunderstanding of materialistic life.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644 
One cannot be happy in any way within this material world. As stated in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3017\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid7616644  (8.16):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e4brahma-bhuvan\'e4l lok\'e4\'f9\line punar \'e4vartino 'rjuna
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
"From the highest planet in this material world down to the lowest, all are places of misery wherein repeated birth and death take place." Therefore, not to speak of going to the moon, even if one is promoted to the highest planetary s
ystem, Brahmaloka, there cannot be any happiness in this material world. If one actually wants happiness, one must go to the spiritual world. The material world is characterized by a struggle for existence, and survival of the fittest is a well-known prin
c
iple, but the poor souls of this material world do not know what is survival and who is fit. Survival does not mean that one should die; survival means that one should not die, but should enjoy an everlastingly blissful life of knowledge. This is survival
. The K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement is meant to make every person fit for survival. Indeed, it is meant to stop the struggle for existence. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  give definite directions on how to stop the struggle for existence and how to survive in eternal life. The }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sa\'eck\'e9rtana}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  movement, therefore, is a great opportunity. Simply by hearing }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4
-mantra,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  one becomes completely purified. Thus the struggle for existence ceases, and one goes back home, back to Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.5.24
\par }\pard\plain \s2994\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\sa60\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid4605116 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 TEXT 24
