{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e7ruta-p\'fcrv\'e4ya}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash but who was heard about from the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 Vedas;}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 vai}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 prabhu\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash Lord Brahm\'e4; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 stutim}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash prayers derived from Vedic literature; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 abr\'fcta}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash performed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 daiv\'e9bhi\'f9}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash by prayers mentioned in the Vedic literature or offered by persons strictly following Vedic principles; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 g\'e9rbhi\'f9}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash 
