unto Him (the Supreme Personality of Godhead); }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nirjita}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash completely controlling; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4tm\'e4}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
\emdash the living entities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4tma-gu\'ebam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash and His external energy; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 para-\'e9\'e7am}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
\emdash the Lord, who is transcendentally situated; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nam\'e4ma}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash we offer our respectful obeisances; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 bh\'fcte\'f1u}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash unto all living beings; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 samam}{\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash equally situated, or equipoised; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 carantam}{
\cs3010\fs28\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 \emdash controlling or ruling them.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s3003\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid6049549 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 No one can overcome the Sup
reme Personality of Godhead's illusory energy [m\'e4y\'e4], which is so strong that it bewilders everyone, making one lose the sense to understand the aim of life. That same m\'e4y\'e4
, however, is subdued by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who rules everyone and who is equally disposed toward all living entities. Let us offer our obeisances unto Him.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 The prowess of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Vi\'f1\'eb
u, certainly controls all living entities, so much so that the living entities have forgotten the aim of life. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Na te vidu\'f9 sv\'e4rtha-gati\'e0 hi vi\'f1\'ebum:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  }{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
the living entities have forgotten that the aim of life is to go back home, back to Godhead. The external energy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead gives all conditioned souls what appears to be an opportunit
y to be happy within this material world, but that is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 m\'e4y\'e4;}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 in other words, it is a dream that is never to be fulfilled. Thus every living being is illusioned by the external energy of the Supreme Lord. That illusory energy is undoubtedly very strong, but 
she is fully under the control of the transcendental person who is described in this verse as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 pare\'e7am,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 the transcendental Lord. The Lord is not a part of the material creation, but is beyond the creation. Therefore, not only does He control the conditioned souls through His external energy, but He also controls the external energy itself. }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 
 clearly says that the strong material energy controls everyone and that getting out of her control is extremely difficult. That controlling energy belongs to
 the Supreme Personality of Godhead and works under His control. The living entities, however, being subdued by the material energy, have forgotten the Supreme Personality of Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.5.31
