seeing Him, we should offer Him our respectful obeisances. We should know that He is complete. Everything is done systematically by His energies (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 par\'e4sya \'e7aktir vividhaiva \'e7r\'fcyate}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 ), and therefore He has nothing to do (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 na tasya k\'e4rya\'e0 kara\'eba\'e0 ca vidyate}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 ). As indicated here by the word }{
