r the original source of all incarnations; he is not eager to see an imposter. The incarnation's activities are proof of His identity. All the incarnations described in the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7\'e4stras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
