 means "that which delivers one from the material world." Only the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 dvijas}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{
