 (the demigods) can be delivered from material existence by the instructions of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Whatever is spoken by the Supreme Personality of Godhead is a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  and is suitable for delivering the conditioned souls from mental speculation. The conditioned souls are engaged in a struggle for existence (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mana\'f9 \'f1a\'f1\'f6h\'e4n
