\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  from the Supreme Personality of Godhead, deliverance is impossible. The beginning }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  is the G\'e4yatr\'e9 }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra.}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  Therefore, after purification, when one is qualified to become a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 br\'e4hma\'eba}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 dvija}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549 ), he is offered the G\'e4yatr\'e9 }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra.}{
\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  Simply by chanting the G\'e4yatr\'e9 }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra,}{\cs3008\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116\charrsid6049549  one can be delivered. This }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra,}{
