ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare\emdash is directly chanted by the Lord Himself, who gives us this }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mantra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  for deliverance.
