ialists who try to get the favor of the goddess of fortune only to possess her for personal enjoyment are frustrated. Theirs is not a good policy. The celebrated demon R\'e4va\'eba, for example, wanted to deprive R\'e4macandra of Lak\'f1m\'e9, S\'e9t\'e4
, and thus be victorious, but the result was just the opposite. S\'e9t\'e4, of course, was taken by force by Lord R\'e4macandra, and R\'e4va\'eb
