\fs28\insrsid4605116  After the demons heard the words of Mohin\'e9-m\'fcrti, who had spoken as if jokingly, they were all very confident. They laughed with gravity, and ultimately they delivered the container of nectar into Her hands.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 The Personality of Godhead in His form of Mohin\'e9
 was certainly not joking but talking seriously, with gravity. The demons, however, being captivated by Mohin\'e9-m\'fcrti's bodily features, took Her words as a joke and confidently delivered the container of nectar into Her hands. Thus Mohin\'e9-m\'fc
rti resembles Lord Buddha, who appeared }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sammoh\'e4ya sura-dvi\'f1\'e4m}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \emdash to cheat the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 asuras.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  The word }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sura-dvi\'f1\'e4m}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  refers to those who are envious of the de
migods or devotees. Sometimes an incarnation of the Supreme Personality of Godhead cheats the atheists. Thus we see here that although Mohin\'e9-m\'fcrti was speaking factually to the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 asuras,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 asuras}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  took Her words to be facetious. Indeed, they were so confident of Mohin\'e9-m\'fc
rti's honesty that they immediately delivered the container of nectar into Her hands, as if they would allow Her to do with the nectar whatever She liked, whether She distributed it, threw it away or drank it Herself without giving it to them.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.9.12
