by the acts of words; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 deha-\'e4tma-ja-\'e4di\'f1u}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash for the sake of one's personal body or family, etc., with reference to the body; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 n\'e5bhi\'f9}{
