thaktv\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash because of separation from the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 tai\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash by the same activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 eva}{
\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash indeed; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sat bhavati}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash becomes factual and permanent; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 yat}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash which; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 kriyate}
