iva heard about the pastimes performed by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Hari, in the form of an attractive woman, he mounted his bull and went to see the Lord. Accompanied by his wife, Um\'e4, and his servants, the }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 bh\'fc
