n, however, that because the ingredients come from Him, He is no longer complete. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid8287567 P}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'fcr\'ebasya p\'fcr\'ebam \'e4d\'e4ya p\'fcr\'ebam ev\'e4va\'e7i\'f1yate: }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid6371270  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "Because He is the complete whole, even though so many complete units emanate from Him, He remains the complete balance." Thus the Lord is called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 avyaya,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  inexhaustible. Unless we accept the Absolute Truth as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 acintya-bhed\'e4bheda,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 simultaneously one and different, we cannot have a clear conception of the Absolute Truth. The Lord is the root of everything. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Aham \'e4dir hi dev\'e4n\'e4m:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  He is the
 original cause of all the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 devas,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  or demigods. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Aha\'e0 sarvasya prabhava\'f9:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid6371270  }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
everything emanates from Him. In all cases\emdash nominative, objective, positive, negative and so on\emdash whatever we may conceive of in this entire cosmic manifestation is in fact the Supreme Lo
rd. For Him there are no such distinctions as "this is mine, and this belongs to someone else," because He is everything. He is therefore called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 avyaya}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \emdash 
changeless and inexhaustible. Because the Supreme Lord is }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 avyaya,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  He is the Absolute Truth, the fully spiritual Supreme Brahman.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.12.6
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid4605116 TEXT 6
