persons desiring the ultimate auspiciousness, the ultimate goal of life; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nir\'e4\'e7i\'f1a\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash without material desire; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 vis\'e5jya}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash 
giving up; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ubhayata\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash in this life and the next; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sa\'ecgam}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash attachment; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 munaya\'f9}{
