\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 brahma}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the all-pervading Absolute Truth; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 p\'fcr\'ebam}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash fully complete; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 am\'e5tam}{
\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash never to be vanquished; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 vigu\'ebam}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash spiritually situated, free from the material modes of nature; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 vi\'e7okam}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 
\emdash without lamentation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4nanda-m\'e4tram}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash always in transcendental bliss; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 avik\'e4ram}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash changeless; }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ananyat}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash separated from everything; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 anyat}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash yet You are everything; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 vi\'e7vasya}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 
\emdash of the cosmic manifestation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 hetu\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the cause; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 udaya}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash of the beginning; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sthiti}{
\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash maintenance; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sa\'e0yam\'e4n\'e4m}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash and of all the directors controlling the various departments of the cosmic manifestation; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4tma-
\'e9\'e7vara\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the Supersoul giving direction to everyone; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 ca}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash also; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 tat-apek\'f1atay\'e4}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash 
everyone depends upon You; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 anapek\'f1a\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash always fully independent.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid4605116 
My Lord, You are the Supreme Brahman, complete in everything. Being completely spiritual, You are eternal, free from the material modes o
f nature, and full of transcendental bliss. Indeed, for You there is no question of lamentation. Since You are the supreme cause, the cause of all causes, nothing can exist without You. Yet we are different from You in a relationship of cause and effect, 
f
or in one sense the cause and effect are different. You are the original cause of creation, manifestation and annihilation, and You bestow benedictions upon all living entities. Everyone depends upon You for the results of his activities, but You are alwa
ys independent.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 The Supreme Personality of Godhead says in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g
\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  (9.4):
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 may\'e4 tatam ida\'e0 sarva\'e0\line jagad avyakta-m\'fcrtin\'e4\line mat-sth\'e4
ni sarva-bh\'fct\'e4ni\line na c\'e4ha\'e0 te\'f1v avasthita\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "By Me, in My unmanifested form, this entire universe is pervaded. All bei
ngs are in Me, but I am not in them." This explains the philosophy of simultaneous oneness and difference, known as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 acintya-bhed\'e4bheda.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 Everything is the Supreme Brahman, the Personality of Godhead, yet the Supreme Person is differently situated from every
thing. Indeed, because the Lord is differently situated from everything material, He is the Supreme Brahman, the supreme cause, the supreme controller. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c9\'e7vara\'f9 parama\'f9}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid9438832  k
\'e5\'f1\'eba\'f9 sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha\'f9}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 .}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  The Lord is the supreme cause, and His form has nothing 
to do with the material modes of nature. The devotee prays: "As Your devotee is completely free from all desires, Your Lordship is also completely free from desires. You are fully independent. Although all living entities engage in Your service, You do no
t depend on the service of anyone. Although this material world is created complete by You, everything depends on Your sanction. As stated in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 matta\'f9 sm\'e5tir j\'ef\'e4nam apohana\'e0 ca:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  remembrance, knowledge and forgetfulness come from You. Nothing ca
n be done independently, yet You act independently of the service rendered by Your servants. The living entities depend on Your mercy for liberation, but when You want to give them liberation, You do not depend on anyone else. Indeed, by Your causeless me
rcy, You can give liberation to anyone. Those who receive Your mercy are called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 k\'e5p\'e4-siddha.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  To reach the platform of perfection takes many, many lives (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 bah\'fcn\'e4\'e0 janman\'e4m ante j\'ef\'e4nav\'e4n m\'e4\'e0 prapadyate}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ). Nonetheless, even without undergoing severe austerities,
 one can attain perfection by Your mercy. Devotional service should be unmotivated and free from impediments (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ahaituky apratihat\'e4 yay\'e4tm\'e4 supras\'e9dati}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ). This is the position of }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 nir\'e4\'e7i\'f1a\'f9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  or freedom from expectations for results. A pure devotee continuously
 offers transcendental loving service to You, but You may nonetheless offer mercy to anyone, without depending on his service."
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.12.8
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid4605116 TEXT 8
