\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the seven }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e5\'f1is}{\fs28\insrsid4605116  of the seven planets; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 na}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash nor; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 mar\'e9ci-mukhy\'e4\'f9}{
