\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid4605116 O my Lord, I, who am considered to be the best of the demigods, and Lord Brahm\'e4
 and the great \'e5\'f1is, headed by Mar\'e9ci, are born of the mode of goodness. Nonetheless, we are bewildered by Your illusory energy and cannot understand what this creation is. Aside from us, what is to be sa
id of others, like the demons and human beings, who are in the base modes of material nature }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 [rajo-gu\'eba and tamo-gu\'eba]}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 ? How will they know You?
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
Factually speaking, even those who are situated in the material mode of goodness cannot understand the position of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. What then is to be said of those who are situated in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 rajo-gu\'eba}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 tamo-gu\'eba,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  the base qualities of material nature? How can we even imagine the Supreme Personality of Godhead? There are so many philosophers t
rying to understand the Absolute Truth, but since they are situated in the base qualities of material nature and are addicted to so many bad habits, like drinking, meat-eating, illicit sex and gambling, how can they conceive of the Supreme Personality of 
Godhead? For them it is impossible. For the present day, the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 p\'e4\'efcar\'e4trik\'e9-vidhi}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  as enunciated by N\'e4rada Muni is the only hope. \'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9
, therefore, has quoted the following verse from the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Brahma-y\'e4mala:
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7ruti-sm\'e5ti-pur\'e4\'eb\'e4di-\line pa\'efcar\'e4tra-vidhi\'e0 vin\'e4\line aik
\'e4ntik\'e9 harer bhaktir\line utp\'e4t\'e4yaiva kalpate
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "Devotional service of the Lord that ignores the authorized Vedic literatures like the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid13383631 Upani\'f1ads, P}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ur\'e4\'ebas}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 N\'e4rada Pa\'efcar\'e4tra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 is simply an unnecessary disturbance in society." (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhakti-ras\'e4m\'e5ta-sindhu}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  1.2.101) 
Those who are very advanced in knowledge and are situated in the mode of goodness follow the Vedic instructions of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7ruti}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sm\'e5ti}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and other religious scriptures, including the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 p\'e4\'efcar\'e4trik\'e9-vidhi.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  Without understanding the Supreme Personality of Godhea
d in this way, one only creates a disturbance. In this age of Kali, so many }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 gurus}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  have sprung up, and because they do not refer to the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e7ruti-sm\'e5ti-pur
\'e4\'eb\'e4di-pa\'efcar\'e4trika-vidhi,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  they are creating a great disturbance in the world in regard to understanding the Absolute Truth. However, those who follow the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 p\'e4\'efcar\'e4trik
\'e9-vidhi}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  under the guidance of a proper spiritual master can understand the Absolute Truth. It is said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 pa\'efcar\'e4trasya k\'e5tsnasya vakt\'e4 tu bhagav\'e4n svayam:}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 pa\'efcar\'e4tra}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  system is spoken by the Supreme Personality of Godhead, just like }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 V\'e4sudeva-\'e7ara\'eb\'e4 vidur a\'efjasaiva:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  the truth can be understood only by one who has taken shelter of the lotus feet of V\'e4sudeva.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 bah\'fcn\'e4\'e0 janman\'e4m ante\line j\'ef\'e4nav\'e4n m\'e4\'e0 prapadyate\line v\'e4
