va can understand the Absolute Truth.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 v\'e4sudeve bhagavati\line bhakti-yoga\'f9 prayojita\'f9\line janayaty \'e4\'e7u vair
