\'f2a-cay\'e4 yad-anta\'f9\line a\'eb\'f2\'e4ntara-stha-param\'e4\'ebu-cay\'e4ntara-stha\'e0\line govindam \'e4di-puru\'f1a\'e0 tam aha\'e0 bhaj\'e4mi
