]. Their companions are Her confidantes, who embody extensions of Her bodily form and who are imbued and permeated with ever-blissful spiritual }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 rasa.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 " (}{
\cs2542\fs28\cf1\insrsid8065737\charrsid8065737 Bs.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  5.37)
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Although Govinda is always present in His abode (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
