\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 yugas.}{\insrsid4605116  He appears as Sanaka, San\'e4tana, Y\'e4j\'efavalkya, Datt\'e4treya and others, and thus He gives instructions in spiritual knowledge, prescribed duties, principles of mystic }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 
