 What is this material body, made of five e
lements? It is different from the spirit soul. Indeed, the spirit soul is completely different from the material elements from which the body is made. But because of bodily attachment, one is regarded as a husband or son. These illusory relationships are 
caused by misunderstanding.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 The spirit soul (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e4tm\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 j\'e9va}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ) is certainly different from the body, which is a combination of five material elements. This is a simple fact, but it is not understood unless one is spiritually educated. Ka\'e7
yapa Muni met h
is wife, Aditi, in the heavenly planets, but the same misconception extends throughout the entire universe and is also here on earth. There are different grades of living entities, but all of them are more or less under the impression of the bodily concep
tion of life. In other words, all living entities in this material world are more or less devoid of spiritual education. The Vedic civilization, however, is based on spiritual education, and spiritual education is the special basis on which }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  was spoken to Arjuna. In the beginning of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a instructed Arjuna to understand that the spirit soul is different from the body.
\par }\pard\plain \s1462\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 dehino 'smin yath\'e4 dehe\line kaum\'e4ra\'e0 yauvana\'e0 jar\'e4\line tath\'e4 deh\'e4
ntara-pr\'e4ptir\line dh\'e9ras tatra na muhyati
\par }\pard\plain \s135\qj \li0\ri0\sb89\sa89\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 "As the embodied so
ul continually passes, in this body, from boyhood to youth to old age, the soul similarly passes into another body at death. The self-realized soul is not bewildered by such a change." (Bg. 2.13) Unfortunately, this spiritual education is completely absen
t
 from modern human civilization. No one understands his real self-interest, which lies with the spirit soul, not with the material body. Education means spiritual education. To work hard in the bodily conception of life, without spiritual education, is to
 live like an animal. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 N\'e4ya\'e0 deho deha-bh\'e4j\'e4\'e0 n\'e5-loke ka\'f1\'f6\'e4n k\'e4m\'e4n arhate vid-bhuj\'e4\'e0 ye}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1837309\charrsid1837309 Bh\'e4g.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  5.5.1). People are working so hard simply for bodily comforts, without education regarding the spirit soul. Thus they are living in a very risky civilization, for 
it is a fact that the spirit soul has to transmigrate from one body to another (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 tath\'e4 deh\'e4ntara-pr\'e4pti\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
). Without spiritual education, people are kept in dark ignorance and do not know what will happen to them after the annihilation of the present body. They are working blindly, and blind leaders are directing them. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Andh
\'e4 yath\'e4ndhair upan\'e9yam\'e4n\'e4s te 'p\'e9\'e7a-tantry\'e4m uru-d\'e4mni baddh\'e4\'f9}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  (}{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid1837309\charrsid1837309 Bh\'e4g.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 7.5.31). A foolish person does not know that he is completely under the bondage of material nature and that after death 
material nature will impose upon him a certain type of body, which he will have to accept. He does not know that although in his present body he may be a very important man, he may next get the body of an animal or tree because of his ignorant activities 
in the modes of material nature. Therefore the K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness movement is trying to give the true light of spiritual existence to all living entities. This movement is not very difficult to understand, and people must take advantage of it, for it will 
save them from the risky life of irresponsibility.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.16.20
