\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 dharma-k\'f1etre kuru-k\'f1etre.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  Because the Lord was present on the Battlefield of Kuruk\'f1etra, it became a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 dharma-k\'f1etra,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
