, becomes a holy place. The chanting of the holy name of the Lord\emdash Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare\emdash 
is pleasing to the ear, and it expands good fortune to the audience who hears it chanted. Owing to the presence of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, Aditi was fully assured that the troublesome condition created for her by the demons would now be ended.

