\par }\pard \qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\insrsid4605116 When Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, thinking V\'e4manadeva to be the son of a }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\insrsid4605116 
