The Vedas enjoin that the factual result of the tree of the body is the good fruits and flowers derived from it. But if the bodily tree d
oes not exist, there is no possibility of factual fruits and flowers. Even if the body is based on untruth, there cannot be factual fruits and flowers without the help of the bodily tree.
