his is also condemned. If one purposely continues this professional begging, he is supposed to be dead while breathing, or, according to another interpretation, such a man of falsity should be killed while still breathing. The Vedic injunction in this reg
ard is as follows: }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 athaitat p\'fcr\'ebam abhy\'e4tma\'e0 yan neti sa yat sarva\'e0 neti br\'fcy\'e4t p\'e4pik\'e4sya k\'e9rtir j\'e4yate.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 saina\'e0
 tatraiva hany\'e4t.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  If one continuously poses himself as possessing nothing and collects money by begging, he should be killed (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 saina\'e0 tatraiva hany\'e4t}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ).

