 to such persons the Lord appears as death and takes away all their possessions by force. Under the circumstances, why should we not part with our possessions and deliver them to Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu for His satisfaction? \'c7r\'e9 C\'e4\'ebakya Pa\'eb\'f2
