ja agreed with great pleasure to accept the punishment awarded him by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. In Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja's dynasty there were many }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 asuras}{\insrsid4605116  who because of their enmity toward Vi\'f1\'eb
u had achieved a destination more exalted than that of many mystic }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 yog\'e9s.}{\insrsid4605116  Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja specifically remembered the determination of Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja in devotional service. Con
