Only by providence have I been forcibly brought under Your lotus feet and deprived of all my opulence. Because of the illusion created by temporary opulence, peop
le in general, who live under material conditions, facing accidental death at every moment, do not understand that this life is temporary. Only by providence have I been saved from that condition.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja appreciated the actions of the Suprem
e Personality of Godhead, although all the members of the demoniac families except Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja and Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja considered Vi\'f1\'ebu their eternal traditional enemy. As described by Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u was actually not the enemy of the family but the best friend of the family. The principle of this friendship has already been stated. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Yasy\'e4ham anug\'e5hn\'e4mi hari\'f1ye tad-dhana\'e0 \'e7anai\'f9: }{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 the Lord bestows special favor upon His devotee by taking away all his material opulences. Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja appreciated this behavior by the Lord. Therefore he said, }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 daivena n\'e9ta\'f9
 prasabha\'e0 ty\'e4jita-\'e7r\'e9\'f9:}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  "It is to bring me to the right platform of eternal life that You have put me into these circumstances."
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Actually, everyone should fear the so-called society, friendship and l
ove for which he works so hard all day and night. As indicated by Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja by the words }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 jan\'e4d bh\'e9ta\'f9,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  every devotee in K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness should always be afraid of the common man engaged in pursuing material prosperity. Such a person is described as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 pramatta,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 a madman chasing the will-o'-the-wisp. Such men do not know that after a hard struggle for life one must change his body, with no certainty of what kind of body he will receive next. Those who are completely established in K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious philos
ophy and who therefore understand the aim of life will never take to the activities of the materialistic dog race. But if a sincere devotee somehow does fall down, the Lord corrects him and saves him from gliding down to the darkest region of hellish life
.
\par }\pard\plain \s1434\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ad\'e4nta-gobhir vi\'e7at\'e4\'e0 tamisra\'e0\line puna\'f9 puna\'e7 carvita-carva\'eb
