ery dangerous. To show special favor, the Lord sometimes makes an example of someone like Bali Mah\'e4r\'e4ja, who was now bereft of all his possessions.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.22.25
