ja did not actually offer obeisances but only endeavored to do so within his mind, the Supreme Personality of Godhead blessed him with more mercy than even the demigods could ever expect. As confirmed in }{\cs2542\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t
