\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ). His personal }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 vi\'f1\'ebu-tattva}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  forms, which are all spiritual, are called }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sv\'e4\'e0\'e7a,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
