For material happiness, the conditioned soul involves himself in fruitive activities, which actually put him into material distress. Because the conditioned soul does not know this, he is said to be in }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 avidy\'e4,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  or ignorance. Because of a false hope for happiness, the conditioned soul becomes involved in various plans for material activity. Here Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja Satyavrata prays that the Lord sever this hard knot of false happiness and thus become his supreme spiritual master.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.24.48
