p; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 malam}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash all the dirty things of material existence; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e4tmana\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash of one's self; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 tama\'f9}{
\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the mode of ignorance, by which one performs pious and impious activities; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 bhajeta}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash may revive; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 var\'ebam}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 
\emdash his original identity; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 nijam}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash one's own; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 e\'f1a\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash such; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sa\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 
\emdash He; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 avyaya\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash inexhaustible; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 bh\'fcy\'e4t}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash let Him become; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 sa\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 
\emdash He; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 \'e9\'e7a\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 parama\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the supreme; }{\cs1998\i\fs28\insrsid4605116 guro\'f9 guru
\'f9}{\fs28\insrsid4605116 \emdash the spiritual master of all other spiritual masters.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 TRANSLATION
\par }\pard\plain \s1217\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sb36\sa65\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid4605116 One who wants to be free of material entanglement should take to the service
 of the Supreme Personality of Godhead and give up the contamination of ignorance, involving pious and impious activities. Thus one regains his original identity, just as a block of gold or silver sheds all dirt and becomes purified when treated with fire
. May that inexhaustible Supreme Personality of Godhead become our spiritual master, for He is the original spiritual master of all other spiritual masters.
\par }\pard\plain \s1187\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\v\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v0\fs28\insrsid4605116 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s537\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 In human life one is meant to undergo austerity to purify one's existence. }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Tapo divya\'e0 putrak\'e4 yena sattva\'e0 \'e7uddhyet.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  Because of contamination by the modes of material nature, one continues in the cycle of birth and death (}{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 k\'e4ra\'eba\'e0 gu\'eba-sa\'ecgo 'sya sad-asad-yoni janmasu}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ). Therefore the purpose of human life is to purify on
eself of this contamination so that one can regain his spiritual form and not undergo this cycle of birth and death. The recommended process of decontamination is devotional service to the Lord. There are various processes for self-realization, such as }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 karma, j\'ef\'e4na}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 yoga,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 but none of them is equal to the process of devotional service. As gold and silver can be freed from all dirty contamination by being put into a fire but not merely by being washed, the living entity can be awakened to his own identity 
by performing devotional service (}{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 yat-sevay\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 ), but not by }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 karma, j\'ef\'e4na}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  or }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 yoga.}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  Cultivation of speculative knowledge or practice of yogic gymnastics will not be helpful.
\par }\pard\plain \s908\qj \fi340\li0\ri0\sa86\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 The word }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 var\'ebam}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 refers to the luster of one's original identity. The original luster of gold or silver is brilliant. Similarly, the original luster of the living being, who is part of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  is the luster of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e4nanda,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  or pleasure. }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c4nandamayo bhy\'e4s\'e4t.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 Every living entity has the right to become }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'e4nandamaya,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  joyful, because he is part of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  K\'e5
\'f1\'eba. Why should the living being be put into tribulation because of dirty contamination by the material modes of nature? The living entity should become purified and regain his }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 svar\'fcpa,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  his original identity. This he can do only by devotional service. Therefore, one should adopt the instructions of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is described here as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guror guru\'f9,}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  the spiritual master of all other spiritual masters.
\par Even though we may not have the fortune to contact the Supreme Lord personally, the Lord's representative is as good as the Lord Himself because such a representative does not say anything unless it is spoken by the Supreme Personality of Godhead. \'c7r
\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu therefore gives a definition of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Y\'e4re dekha, t\'e4re kaha 'k\'e5\'f1\'eba'-upade\'e7a:}{\cs1998\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 
 }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 the bona fide }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  is he who advises his disciples exactly in accordance with the principles spoken by K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The bona fide }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  is he who has accepted K\'e5\'f1\'eba as }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  This is the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru-parampar\'e4}{
\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  system. The original }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  is Vy\'e4sadeva because he is the speaker of }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam,}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  wherein everything spoken relates to K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Therefore }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru-p\'fcj\'e4}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  is known as Vy\'e4sa-p
\'fcj\'e4. In the final analysis, the original }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  is K\'e5\'f1\'eba, His disciple is N\'e4rada, whose disciple is Vy\'e4sa, and in this way we gradually come in touch with the }{
\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru-parampar\'e4.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  One cannot become a }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  if he does not know what the Personality of Godhead K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a or His incarnation wants. The mission of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  is the mission of the Supreme Personality of Godhead: to spread K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness all over the world.
\par }\pard\plain \s1467\qr \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid4605116 SB 8.24.49
\par }\pard\plain \s1167\qc \li0\ri0\sb240\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\insrsid4605116 TEXT 49
