\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 guru}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  and find out the goal of life. Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Satyavrata, therefore, shows us the way of the }{\cs1998\i\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116 mah\'e4jana.}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4605116  }{
