\'c7r\'e9la Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kura says, }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 t\'e4\'ecdera cara\'eba sevi bhakta-sane v\'e4sa janame janame haya, ei abhil\'e4\'f1a.}{\insrsid4605116  I am attempting to present }{\cs1998\i\insrsid4605116 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh
